1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,278
Worked example two point six.

2
00:00:02,278 --> 00:00:07,981
Equal volumes of two millimolar barium chloride and sodium sulphate are mixed.

3
00:00:07,981 --> 00:00:12,513
The trap: mixing equal volumes halves each concentration.

4
00:00:12,513 --> 00:00:16,783
So each ion is one times ten to the minus three molar.

